  "bodyHash": "74c495c4afa0a202",
  "content": "\n\n<p>這個模組以一種名為 Siblium 的新礦石為核心。它新增了數套新盔甲與新型武器（例如帶有<span style=\"color:#000\">爆炸</span>效果的箭矢，或是能賦予凋零效果的劍）。以下為您展示部分特色範例：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><strong>礦石</strong></span></p>\n<p>Siblium Evolution 新增了數種新礦石：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-Siblium\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186635587327893514/image.png?ex=6593f782&is=65818282&hm=16b6d4a9d3a300a426e79862a257c7303bb891601b746ad7301ab24c0a2d01eb&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=862&height=623\" alt=\"siblium gamme\" width=\"470\" height=\"340\">-Cesium\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186636092187885610/image.png?ex=6593f7fb&is=658182fb&hm=12c8d4332c3029d391c83bd4056f91902cfb57e37f24d62eab856762fe82a162&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=843&height=623\" alt=\"gamme Cesium\" width=\"470\" height=\"347\"></p>\n<p>（銫與鈦礦石各有專屬的盔甲。）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#f00\">盔甲</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Siblium Evolution 也新增了部分新盔甲：</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">-銫盔甲</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186638701288239104/image.png?ex=6593fa69&is=65818569&hm=b9bcebf0b8437db73ad5a8cde0eb97a2acfed60c070ab2f8681314157d4ce530&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=612&height=623\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"379\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">銫盔甲並非為了戰鬥而設計，而是為了環遊世界，因此</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">它會賦予您一些效果，例如加速或夜視。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">-紫水晶盔甲</span></p>\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186639331025223680/image.png?ex=6593faff&is=658185ff&hm=0f8af2f03fb7f244e38b8378e2a23102e202a7687e4256d7942f299ffa13a199&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=678&height=623\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"343\">\n<p>這套盔甲純粹為了炫耀而設計，沒有任何特殊能力。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-銅盔甲\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186639998490005604/image.png?ex=6593fb9e&is=6581869e&hm=4856ba846bc15b3b4bb6acbe3da68e2e4212f4ac348b9270de54db1d9783c9d5&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=731&height=623\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"327\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">銅盔甲是為遊戲初期設計的，當您擁有全套鐵裝時，它並不</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">怎麼實用。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">-Cesiane 盔甲</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186641210291539968/image.png?ex=6593fcbf&is=658187bf&hm=46c71fd8711e57d1b0b4553e5fbcd9c1ed5db1c2ac7901b3e2b561048dacaaa7&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=590&height=623\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"396\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Cesiane 裝備是此模組的終極裝備。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">神明砧（GOD'S ANVIL）</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>神明砧是本模組的核心工作台。</p>\n<p>使用它可以製作 Cesiane 盔甲與其他武器。</p>\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186642007091851335/image.png?ex=6593fd7d&is=6581887d&hm=a2c8a74d2f96415e07eeeae8a562923e2bfe7caa5d974df1ea1c48602907a3c3&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=406&height=623\" alt=\"\" width=\"296\" height=\"454\">\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186642706785632347/image.png?ex=6593fe24&is=65818924&hm=b03c4329f62381c6c42ed907e44a8861e09386eb45216bc3692f3e43a2682bb9&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" alt=\"\" width=\"685\" height=\"353\">\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1176249109137608754/1186642826126164019/image.png?ex=6593fe40&is=65818940&hm=859891eb8f2b97d0866897f5789893cec14ac102a7a561a14e617a9931e81919&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" alt=\"\" width=\"293\" height=\"133\">\n<p>/!\\ 您需要在橙色槽位中放入一桶熔岩 /!\\</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
